        "checkedAt": "2026-11-11T17:53:29.871Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Today, we’re announcing usage-based metering for Amazon SageMaker bidirectional (bidi) streaming inference, so model providers can report actual usage for the AWS Marketplace software charge.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/introducing-usage-based-pricing-for-amazon-sagemaker-ai-bidirectional-streaming/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-11T15:10:23.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-11T17:53:29.871Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "First, we introduced bidirectional streaming for real-time inference on Amazon SageMaker AI , which supports long-lived bidirectional streams between clients and model servers.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/introducing-usage-based-pricing-for-amazon-sagemaker-ai-bidirectional-streaming/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-11T15:10:23.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-11T17:53:29.871Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Now, with usage-based metering, we further strengthen the foundation for production real-time AI, aligning billing with how customers consume streaming and real-time AI workloads.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/introducing-usage-based-pricing-for-amazon-sagemaker-ai-bidirectional-streaming/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-11T15:10:23.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-11T17:53:29.871Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "A client streams audio and receives transcriptions through the SageMaker AI API using an HTTP/2 event stream.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/introducing-usage-based-pricing-for-amazon-sagemaker-ai-bidirectional-streaming/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-11T15:10:23.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-11T17:53:29.871Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "When a bidirectional streaming session starts, SageMaker AI establishes two connections to the model server:",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/introducing-usage-based-pricing-for-amazon-sagemaker-ai-bidirectional-streaming/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-11T15:10:23.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-11T17:53:29.871Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Subscribe to the Deepgram Voice AI streaming model you need on AWS Marketplace, such as Deepgram Nova-3 Monolingual Speech-to-Text (STT) Streaming .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/introducing-usage-based-pricing-for-amazon-sagemaker-ai-bidirectional-streaming/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
